Third-party material
--------------------

IINA (https://github.com/iina/iina), GPL-3.0
  config/input.conf is IINA's iina-default-input.conf with the macOS Command
  key mapped to Ctrl. The control-bar layout follows IINA's on-screen
  controller design.

mpv / libmpv (https://mpv.io), GPL-2.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later
  Videoina links against libmpv. Release builds bundle it: on Windows the
  shinchiro build (https://github.com/shinchiro/mpv-winbuild-cmake,
  mpv commit a2cd83c56d), on Linux Ubuntu 22.04's libmpv package, along with
  the FFmpeg and other libraries it depends on. Their source code is available
  from those projects.

Qt 6 (https://www.qt.io), LGPL-3.0
  Release builds bundle the Qt libraries unmodified, as shared libraries.
  Source: https://download.qt.io/official_releases/qt/

Icons are original vector paths drawn for Videoina.
